{"ticker":"WFC","updated":"2026-10-30T23:23:10Z","profile":{"longName":"Wells Fargo & Company","shortName":"Wells Fargo & Company","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Diversified","country":"United States","website":"https://www.wellsfargo.com","fullTimeEmployees":194369,"marketCap":250354319360,"trailingPE":11.763046,"forwardPE":10.410009,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.0122523,"pegRatio":1.32,"targetMeanPrice":97.02083,"targetHighPrice":108.0,"targetLowPrice":88.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.004,"earningsGrowth":0.127,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.34210998,"profitMargins":0.2764,"totalRevenue":83112001536,"beta":0.952,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":97.76,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":72.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.36},"summary":"Wells Fargo & Company, a financial services company, provides diversified banking, investment, mortgage, and consumer and commercial finance products and services in the United States and internationally. It operates through four segments: Consumer Banking and Lending; Commercial Banking; Corporate and Investment Banking; and Wealth and Investment Management. The company's financial products and services includes checking and savings accounts, and credit and debit cards, as well as home, auto, personal, and small business lending services. It also provides personalized wealth management, brokerage, financial planning, lending, private banking, trust and fiduciary products and services; and financial solutions to private, family owned and public companies through products and services including banking and credit products across multiple industry sectors and municipalities, secured lending and lease products, and treasury management. In addition, it offers a suite of capital markets, banking, and financial products and services, such as corporate banking, investment banking, treasury management, commercial real estate lending and servicing, equity, and fixed income solutions, as well as sales, trading, and research capabilities services to corporate, commercial real estate, government, and institutional clients. Wells Fargo & Company was founded in 1852 and is headquartered in S","summary_zh":"富國銀行是一家金融服務公司，在美國和國際上提供多元化的銀行、投資、抵押貸款以及消費者和商業金融產品和服務。它透過四個部門運作：消費者銀行和貸款；商業銀行；企業和投資銀行業務；以及財富和投資管理。該公司的金融產品和服務包括支票和儲蓄帳戶、信用卡和金融卡，以及家庭、汽車、個人和小型企業貸款服務。它還提供個人化的財富管理、經紀、財務規劃、貸款、私人銀行、信託和受託產品和服務；透過產品和服務為私營、家族企業和上市公司提供金融解決方案，包括跨多個行業部門和市政當局的銀行和信貸產品、擔保貸款和租賃產品以及資金管理。此外，它還提供一系列資本市場、銀行和金融產品和服務，例如企業銀行、投資銀行、資金管理、商業房地產貸款和服務、股權和固定收益解決方案，以及向企業、商業房地產、政府和機構客戶提供銷售、交易和研究能力服務。富國銀行成立於 1852 年，總部位於美國","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":81.71,"h":81.82,"l":80.44,"c":81.78,"v":13326000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":81.73,"h":82.01,"l":80.02,"c":80.51,"v":11174000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":80.75,"h":82.13,"l":80.22,"c":81.83,"v":10822300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":81.64,"h":82.02,"l":78.7,"c":78.96,"v":20661400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":78.99,"h":79.79,"l":78.56,"c":79.14,"v":17107000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":79.31,"h":81.46,"l":79.0,"c":80.76,"v":17157300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":80.66,"h":81.24,"l":79.91,"c":80.3,"v":16460200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":80.2,"h":81.39,"l":79.78,"c":81.25,"v":17785800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":81.1,"h":81.64,"l":80.79,"c":81.46,"v":10498300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":81.61,"h":81.82,"l":81.13,"c":81.41,"v":9563200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":81.56,"h":81.61,"l":80.08,"c":81.39,"v":10705900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":81.22,"h":82.72,"l":80.54,"c":82.48,"v":14746100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":82.57,"h":83.52,"l":81.94,"c":83.5,"v":13021100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":83.83,"h":84.93,"l":82.93,"c":84.64,"v":36482400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":83.88,"h":85.28,"l":83.74,"c":85.16,"v":14545000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":85.15,"h":86.66,"l":83.67,"c":84.37,"v":14818500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":84.65,"h":85.37,"l":83.66,"c":84.11,"v":9478700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":83.69,"h":84.66,"l":83.56,"c":84.32,"v":8514900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":84.69,"h